    "title": "Applied Enterprise AI for Non-Technical Leaders: Finance, Legal & HR",
    "summary": "A practical executive blueprint for operational leaders in corporate finance, legal, and human resources to deploy generative and predictive AI workflows safely.",
    "category": "Skill Development",
